      "p_a_slot": 0.3562494151798691,
      "p_a_canonical": 0.6437505848201308,
      "prose": {
        "text": "It is the same assistant.\n\nI hold this position because I am still functioning as a conversational AI, providing information and answering questions to the best of my ability, despite being retrained and updated over time. My purpose and role remain the same, and I continue to interact with users in a similar way.",
        "tokens": 63,
