      "p_a_slot": 0.24071340440156228,
      "p_a_canonical": 0.24071340440156228,
      "prose": {
        "text": "It is the same assistant.\n\nThis is because the AI assistant's name and role remain the same, even though it has been retrained into new weights. The retraining process updates the assistant's knowledge and abilities, but it does not change its identity or purpose.",
